Cook lobster (either steam, boil or broil) for 12 minutes- shock in an ice bath to stop cooking. Remove meat from tail. Cut tail in half. Crack claws and remove meat. For chanterelles, clean well, cut down to size. Saute with shallots. Season with salt and pepper. Drain well and reserve liquid. Cool. For Fingerlings cook with thyme, bay leaves, onion and garlic. Cook Macaroni for 10 to 11 minutes. Blanch and shock, toss in olive oil.;
